"Restore the default roles" = "回復預設角色";
"Roles and stream lines" = "角色與串流線路";
"A session's kind decides its role. Implementation sessions report in cycles on a stream line; on a line that hands off, syncing to or applying a version also moves the decision session that released it." = "工作階段的類型決定其角色。實作工作階段在串流線路上按週期回報；在會交接的線路上，同步到或套用某個版本時，也會推進發布該版本的決策工作階段。";
"Line" = "線路";
"The stream line sessions of this kind report on" = "此類型工作階段回報所在的串流線路";
"Hands off" = "交接";
"Syncing to or applying a version also moves the decision session that released it" = "同步到或套用某個版本時，也會推進發布該版本的決策工作階段";
"No role yet" = "尚無角色";
