"Remove this kind's rule" = "移除此類型的規則";
"Projects appear here with their first report." = "專案會在第一次回報時出現在這裡。";
"Baselines are the versions sessions start from. Git tags are read from the repository, folder names from the folder and the sub-folders listed (not deeper). The pattern is a regular expression whose first group is the version." = "基準版本是工作階段起步時所依據的版本。Git 標籤從存放庫讀取，資料夾名稱從該資料夾及所列子資料夾讀取（不再深入）。樣式是正規表示式，其第一個群組即為版本。";
