/* Ledger: Track agents I start and auto-continue. */
"Track agents I start" = "追蹤我啟動的代理程式";
"Give them the Ledger tools" = "同時提供帳本工具";
"Agents Gitrochi starts" = "Gitrochi 啟動的代理程式";
"Claude Code agents started from Gitrochi get a ledger session before they start, and their activity is recorded: times and IDs, never what anyone types. The Ledger tools let them report to it; they are left out when Claude Code already has a server named gitrochi-ledger." = "從 Gitrochi 啟動的 Claude Code 代理程式會在啟動前取得一個帳本工作階段，並記錄其活動：只記錄時間和 ID，從不記錄任何人輸入的內容。帳本工具讓代理程式可以向帳本回報；如果 Claude Code 已有名為 gitrochi-ledger 的伺服器，就不加入。";
"Continue automatically when nobody answers" = "無人回答時自動繼續";
"Wait" = "等待";
"%lld s" = "%lld 秒";
"Open a repository to set auto-continue for it." = "開啟一個存放庫來設定它的自動繼續。";
"When an agent started in the repository asks you something and nobody answers in time, Gitrochi answers with the agent's recommended option, at most three times in a row. It never answers decision sessions or allows risky commands, and each answer waits in the Inbox for review. It applies to agents started afterwards, with Track agents I start on." = "當在該存放庫中啟動的代理程式向你提問而無人及時回答時，Gitrochi 會用代理程式推薦的選項回答，最多連續三次。它從不回答決策工作階段，也不允許有風險的指令，每個回答都會在收件匣中等待審閱。適用於之後在「追蹤我啟動的代理程式」開啟時啟動的代理程式。";
"Decision sessions never continue automatically." = "決策工作階段從不自動繼續。";
"Use the default" = "使用預設值";
"Follow the repository's or the default auto-continue setting again" = "重新遵循存放庫或預設的自動繼續設定";
"Works for Claude Code agents Gitrochi starts while Track agents I start is on. A longer wait reaches a running agent when it starts again." = "適用於「追蹤我啟動的代理程式」開啟時由 Gitrochi 啟動的 Claude Code 代理程式。較長的等待時間會在執行中的代理程式下次啟動時生效。";
"Auto-continue changed for %@" = "已變更 %@ 的自動繼續";
"Stop waiting here and answer in the agent's own terminal" = "不在這裡等待，改在代理程式自己的終端機中回答";
"Not this time" = "這次不用";
"No automatic answer for this prompt: it waits for you in the agent's terminal" = "此請求不自動回答：它會在代理程式的終端機中等你";
"Recommended" = "推薦";
"The terminal shows this request too; an answer there counts as well." = "終端機也會顯示此請求；在那裡回答同樣有效。";
"The terminal shows this question only after the wait." = "終端機要等待結束後才會顯示此問題。";
"Not confirmed yet: the terminal showed its own dialog too" = "尚未確認：終端機也顯示了自己的對話框";
"Unknown whether it applied: the terminal showed its own dialog too" = "不確定是否生效：終端機也顯示了自己的對話框";
"Approve the plan" = "核准計畫";
"Allow once" = "允許一次";
"%@ started without the Ledger: %@" = "%@ 已在沒有帳本的情況下啟動：%@";
